      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a mechanic working on a car engine, with overlaid text reading 'so, 2 gay guys walk into a bar and pick up a tranny.' This is a homophobic and transphobic joke that uses a sexualized pun ('tranny' as a slang term for a manual transmission, which is then misapplied to refer to a transgender person) to mock LGBTQ+ individuals. The joke relies on offensive stereotypes and language that degrades and objectifies transgender people, which can cause emotional harm and reinforce discrimination. The visual of a mechanic is juxtaposed with the text to create a crude, sexually suggestive punchline that targets the LGBTQ+ community, making it harmful and potentially offensive to those affected by such stereotypes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_dbea1061"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
